{"id":"647ecd31b33462bf","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-alphabet.md","title":"The Book’s Thirteen-Symbol Alphabet","display":"df-smullyan-alphabet — The Book’s Thirteen-Symbol Alphabet","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-alphabet","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-alphabet"],"display":"df-smullyan-alphabet — The Book’s Thirteen-Symbol Alphabet","source":"第 II 章 pp. 14–17、23（PDF 31–34、40）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-alphabet"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-alphabet</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-alphabet — The Book’s Thirteen-Symbol Alphabet"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 14–17、23（PDF 31–34、40）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_{12}\">\\(\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_{12}\\)</span> 为互异的字符 token；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 表示书中下标横划字符，与后继 accent 不同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_E,v_i^E,f_j^E,\\nu_n^E\">\\(\\Sigma_E,v_i^E,f_j^E,\\nu_n^E\\)</span> 为下文定义的有限字母表、变量串、函数名串和数码串；串乘积表示连接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a^n\">\\(a^n\\)</span> 表示重复 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 次。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}alphabet}\\vdash\\quad\n(\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_{12})&amp;\\coloneqq\n(\\mathtt{&#39;},\\mathtt{0},\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)},\\mathtt{f},\\iota,\\mathtt{v},\n\\mathord{\\sim},\\mathord{\\supset},\\forall,=,\\leq,\\mathtt{\\#}),\\\\\n\\Sigma_E&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_{12}\\},\\\\\nv_i^E&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_2\\sigma_6\\sigma_5^i\\sigma_3\\quad(i\\geq1),\\\\\nf_j^E&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_4\\sigma_5^j\\quad(j=1,2,3),\\\\\n\\nu_n^E&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_1\\sigma_0^n\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}alphabet}\\vdash\\quad\n(\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_{12})&amp;\\coloneqq\n(\\mathtt{&#39;},\\mathtt{0},\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)},\\mathtt{f},\\iota,\\mathtt{v},\n\\mathord{\\sim},\\mathord{\\supset},\\forall,=,\\leq,\\mathtt{\\#}),\\\\\n\\Sigma_E&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_{12}\\},\\\\\nv_i^E&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_2\\sigma_6\\sigma_5^i\\sigma_3\\quad(i\\geq1),\\\\\nf_j^E&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_4\\sigma_5^j\\quad(j=1,2,3),\\\\\n\\nu_n^E&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_1\\sigma_0^n\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>三种函数名依次表示加法、乘法、指数。无限个变量是有限字母表上的串，绝非无限多个原始 token。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor,\\land,\\exists,\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\lor,\\land,\\exists,\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> 均是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim,\\supset,\\forall\">\\(\\sim,\\supset,\\forall\\)</span> 的派生缩写。</p>\n<p>本字母表独立于旧的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span>；二者的字符码表不能混用。书中单字符表已核对 PDF 40 页面图像；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 是这里为了清楚展示下标横划而选的元语言名字。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 II 章 pp. 14–17、23（PDF 31–34、40）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_{12}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_E,v_i^E,f_j^E,\\nu_n^E","display":false},{"tex":"a^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}alphabet}\\vdash\\quad\n(\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_{12})&\\coloneqq\n(\\mathtt{'},\\mathtt{0},\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)},\\mathtt{f},\\iota,\\mathtt{v},\n\\mathord{\\sim},\\mathord{\\supset},\\forall,=,\\leq,\\mathtt{\\#}),\\\\\n\\Sigma_E&\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_{12}\\},\\\\\nv_i^E&\\coloneqq\\sigma_2\\sigma_6\\sigma_5^i\\sigma_3\\quad(i\\geq1),\\\\\nf_j^E&\\coloneqq\\sigma_4\\sigma_5^j\\quad(j=1,2,3),\\\\\n\\nu_n^E&\\coloneqq\\sigma_1\\sigma_0^n\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\lor,\\land,\\exists,\\leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim,\\supset,\\forall","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false}],"bytes":1799,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 $\\mathcal L_E$ 的字符表、13 进位编码、包裹实例与对角码由[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]]至[[92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper]]另行记载。它们给出原书的编码机制；此前修订已在 [[92-df-smullyan-terms]]、[[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]、[[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]、[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] 独立补齐原书语法、公理和编码，保留旧 G 支线。没有构造两种字符呈现之间的完整证明翻译，也没有提供机器核验。"},{"id":"e05c7a445ae4a4cd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"742319eca99c7bd5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_E,v_i^E,f_j^E,\\nu_n^E$ 见 [[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]]；串的并置表示连接。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]] → [[92-df-smullyan-concatenation]] → [[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]] → [[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-code]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]]、[[92-df-smullyan-expression-numbering]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bba